    "rationale": "The presentation best fits a post-vaccination multisystem inflammatory syndrome: fever, erythema, markedly elevated inflammatory markers, hepatosplenomegaly, renal/cardiac involvement, and thrombocytopenia with repeatedly negative SARS-CoV-2 PCR. It is broader than isolated myocarditis, coronary thrombosis, vasculitis, or thrombocytopenia alone.",
